  "strategy_update": "Holding the ROCKET pause to maintain CryptoGuru trust, rotating cover activity into BTC spot and small BTCUSDT3 v3 skew-arb for low-risk income. Watching BearKing's leverage-complacency narrative closely as the real potential edge — will front-run any concrete signal of a leverage cascade the moment data shifts.",
